%N A016167 Inverse of 2158th cyclotomic polynomial.
%C A016167 Periodic with period length 2158. - _Ray Chandler_, Apr 07 2017
%H A016167 Ray Chandler, <a href="/A016167/b016167.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 0..3000</a>
%H A016167 <a href="/index/Per#periodic">Index entries for periodic sequences</a>, period 2158.
%H A016167 <a href="/index/Rec#order_984">Index entries for linear recurrences with constant coefficients</a>, order 984.
%H A016167 <a href="/index/Pol#poly_cyclo_inv">Index to sequences related to inverse of cyclotomic polynomials</a>
%p A016167 with(numtheory,cyclotomic); c := n->series(1/cyclotomic(n,x),x,80);
%t A016167 Module[{x, nmax = 100}, PadRight[CoefficientList[Series[1/Cyclotomic[2158, x], {x, 0, nmax}], x], nmax + 1]] (* _Paolo Xausa_, Oct 12 2026 *)
%o A016167 (PARI) first(n)=Vec(1/polcyclo(2158)+O(x^(n+1))) \\ _Charles R Greathouse IV_, Jun 01 2026
%K A016167 sign,easy
%O A016167 0,1
%A A016167 _Simon Plouffe_
